  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6603.02 Handling, Loading and Unloading",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6603.02 Handling, Loading and Unloading.\n\n(a) All high-level radioactive waste shall be handled, loaded and unloaded in the manner as required by:\n\n(1) 49 CFR 107, 171 through 180, and 390 through 397;\n\n(2) Saf-C 600; and\n\n(3) All other applicable state and federal laws.\n\nSource. #7287, eff 5-24-00; ss by #9154, eff 5-8-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6600.html"
